  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ΔT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub></mfrac></math><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>0.954</mn><mn>4.88</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></math><br />Atomic weight of sulphur = 32<br />Number of sulphur atom <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>weight</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>weight</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>256</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />Hence Molecular formula <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msub></math> .</p>",
